    "playWhen": "When communication feels formal or careful. Pair with Whisper Line — Unsent is the draft, Whisper is the delivery.",
    "makeItLand": "Read it as written, typos and all. Don't polish it in the retelling. **Watch out:** Don't use this to deliver a delayed criticism. Keep it to the tender/funny/inviting drafts.",
