    "whyPromptsWork": "Every prompt asks for *artifacts* of belonging: uniform, motto, handshake, crest, beverage, vow, festival. You learn what your partner finds sacred by what they make silly.",
    "playWhen": "When you want inside jokes, fast. Pair with Couple Mascot — Cult is the society, Mascot is the creature.",
    "makeItLand": "Actually invent the handshake or greeting and do it. **Watch out:** Keep it clearly unserious — “very unserious society” is in the prompts for a reason.",
    "watchOut": "Keep it clearly unserious — “very unserious society” is in the prompts for a reason.",
    "twist": "Invent a 10-second initiation for new members (there are no new members, it's just you two)."
